From c7861a7a8300515dac5194f5c40ec2d098790700 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 02:55:35 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UI/UX improvements: pending picks, locked games, result
 icons, theme tokens

- Show unsubmitted pick changes in My Picks (with undo), make the Submit
  button show the change count and disable it when nothing changed, limit
  it to the 600px content width, and warn before leaving with unsaved picks
- Lock and dim games that have kicked off instead of only showing an
  error toast on click
- Make Game Info a real link-button for keyboard/screen-reader access
- Add win/loss/push icons so results aren't conveyed by color alone
- Pick History: dark-theme week headers, theme result colors, neutral
  color for 0, heading naming whose history it is, Dispute only on your
  own history
- Standings: fix invalid Alert severity, highlight the current user, add
  GOTW Wins column for 2026+, collapse duplicated row rendering
- Week Picks: show display names and group picks by user
- StevenButton only forces the white fill on contained buttons
- Centralize colors in src/theme.js and CSS variables in index.css

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FudKSbHSVc9gMong6sdNTY
